{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"fcaa20905e646fef52638ee11406d121669ccd5d9c1cdf8154b5f6c31cc2988f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2452},"chapter":{"number":58,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["求上帝罰惡"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["大衛的金詩，交與伶長。調用休要毀壞。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"世人哪，你們默然不語，真合公義嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"施行審判，豈按正直嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不然！你們是心中作惡；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們在地上秤出你們手所行的強暴。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"惡人一出母胎就與上帝疏遠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一離母腹便走錯路，說謊話。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的毒氣好像蛇的毒氣；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們好像塞耳的聾虺，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不聽行法術的聲音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖用極靈的咒語也是不聽。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"上帝啊，求你敲碎他們口中的牙！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，求你敲掉少壯獅子的大牙！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願他們消滅，如急流的水一般；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們瞅準射箭的時候，願箭頭彷彿砍斷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願他們像蝸牛消化過去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像婦人墜落未見天日的胎。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們用荊棘燒火，鍋還未熱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他要用旋風把青的和燒着的一齊颳去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"義人見仇敵遭報就歡喜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要在惡人的血中洗腳。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，人必說：義人誠然有善報；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在地上果有施行判斷的上帝！","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/58.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/59.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/57.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}